## Proposed Changes

### Component 1 — Prisma Schema

#### [MODIFY] [schema.prisma](file:///c:/DEV/STO/prisma/schema.prisma)

**New Models:**

1. **`MaintenanceStrategy`** — Reusable library of maintenance approaches
   - `id`, `organization_id`, `name`, `code`, `description`
   - `equipment_types` (String[]), `maintenance_category`, `industry_codes` (String[])
   - `default_template_id` (FK → workpack_templates)
   - `estimated_duration_hours`, `estimated_crew_size`
   - `knowledge_source`, `revision`, `approval_status`
   - `created_by`, `updated_by`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`
   - Index: `[organization_id, code]`, `[organization_id, equipment_types]`

2. **`WorkpackInstantiation`** — Full traceability record per workpack
   - `id`, `organization_id`, `workpack_id` (unique FK → Workpack)
   - `scope_item_id` (FK → ScopeItem)
   - `scope_id` (FK → ShutdownScope)
   - `strategy_id` (FK → MaintenanceStrategy)
   - `template_id`, `template_revision`, `template_family_id`
   - `asset_id`, `event_id`
   - `readiness_score`, `compliance_score`
   - `readiness_detail` (Json), `compliance_detail` (Json)
   - `ai_recommendations` (Json)
   - `instantiated_by`, `instantiated_at`
   - Index: `[scope_id]`, `[scope_item_id]`, `[workpack_id]`

**Modified Models:**

3. **`ScopeItem`** — Add `workpack_id` (nullable FK to track which workpack was created)
4. **`Workpack`** — Add `scope_item_id` (nullable FK), `strategy_id` (nullable FK), `readiness_score` (Int, default 0), `compliance_score` (Int, default 0)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> We do NOT remove the existing direct workpack creation path. M7.4 adds the **scope-gated** creation path. Legacy workpacks (pre-scope) remain valid. The Intelligence Engine is the **recommended** path.

