### Component 3 — Workpack Intelligence Engine (Core)

#### [NEW] [WorkpackIntelligenceService.ts](file:///c:/DEV/STO/src/core/workpack-intelligence/WorkpackIntelligenceService.ts)

The central engine. Methods:

- `instantiateFromScope()` — **The main entry point**
  1. Validates scope item is from an approved/frozen scope
  2. Validates strategy is approved
  3. Validates template is PUBLISHED
  4. Calls existing `TemplateLibraryService.instantiate()` to create workpack + activities
  5. Materializes resources from `resources_json`
  6. Materializes materials from `materials_json`
  7. Materializes certificates from `qaqc_json` + `certificate_templates`
  8. Materializes documents from `references_json`
  9. Auto-attaches asset documents (P&ID, OEM, datasheets)
  10. Creates `WorkpackInstantiation` traceability record
  11. Computes initial readiness + compliance scores
  12. Links `ScopeItem.workpack_id` back
  13. Audit log

- `bulkInstantiate()` — Multiple scope items at once (batch)

