### Component 4 — Readiness Score Engine

#### [NEW] [ReadinessScoreService.ts](file:///c:/DEV/STO/src/core/workpack-intelligence/ReadinessScoreService.ts)

Computes readiness as % of 12 checklist items:

| Criterion | Weight | Check |
|-----------|--------|-------|
| Template Selected | 8% | `workpack.template_id` not null |
| Activities Generated | 10% | Activity count > 0 |
| Documents Attached | 8% | WorkpackDocument count > 0 |
| Resources Assigned | 10% | ActivityResource count > 0 |
| Materials Available | 10% | WorkpackMaterial with status != 'pending' |
| QA Package | 8% | qa_clearance or FormInstance exists |
| Certificates | 8% | CertificateInstance count matches template |
| Permits | 8% | Relevant form/cert for permits |
| Isolation Plan | 8% | Blind records exist |
| Execution Calendar | 8% | planned_start_date and planned_end_date set |
| Crew Assigned | 7% | Resources with headcount > 0 |
| Approval | 7% | approval_status = 'approved' |

Methods:
- `computeReadiness(workpackId)` → `{ score: number, detail: {...} }`
- `batchComputeReadiness(scopeId)` → all workpacks for a scope

