### Component 5 — Compliance Score Engine

#### [NEW] [ComplianceScoreService.ts](file:///c:/DEV/STO/src/core/workpack-intelligence/ComplianceScoreService.ts)

Compares instantiated workpack against originating template:

| Tracked Deviation | Severity |
|-------------------|----------|
| Activities Added | Minor |
| Activities Removed | Critical |
| QA Removed | Critical |
| Certificates Removed | Critical |
| Materials Changed | Minor |
| Safety Requirements Changed | Critical |
| Resources Changed | Minor |

Methods:
- `computeCompliance(workpackId)` → `{ score: number, critical: [], minor: [] }`
- `listDeviations(workpackId)` → detailed deviation list

