## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q1: Legacy workpack creation** — Should the existing direct workpack creation (`POST /api/workpacks`) remain available, or should it be disabled/gated once M7.4 is active? My recommendation: keep it available but add a soft warning in the UI.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q2: Planner-editable fields** — The spec says planners SHALL NOT edit Activity Structure, QA Structure, Certificate Definitions, etc. Should we enforce this with a `is_template_locked` flag on those records, or rely on UI-level restrictions?

